      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Page opened the lid of the in-flight meal, only for his face to immediately darken.",
        "zh": "周书迫不及待地掀开飞机餐的盖子，但立刻露出了不妙的神情。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": -1,
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": {
