    {
      "index": 20,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yep! I’m a Taoist priest! Though honestly, it’s not like we’re required to wear this all the time. I just find the robes really comfortable, so I just kept wearing them.",
        "zh": "对啊，我是道士嘛！不过其实也没有要求说一直穿着的，但我觉得道袍穿着很舒服，所以就一直这样穿了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "There aren’t any Taoist priests in Wenqiu City, so I’m curious. What’s a Taoist’s daily life like?",
        "zh": "纹秋市里从来没有道士呢，我有些好奇，道士的生活是什么样的？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Nothing too special, really. Our sect focuses more on talismans and spiritual techniques, but I’m terrible at all those complicated rituals and incantations.",
        "zh": "也没什么特别的吧，我们道派本来算是偏向术法符文专精的，但我实在学不来那些弯弯绕绕的仪式法咒。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "But I’m pretty fit physically, so I mostly just train my body and practice swordplay...",
        "zh": "不过我身体素质很好，所以基本就一直在炼体和练剑来着......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_疑惑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’m not sure I follow...",
        "zh": "有点听不明白......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah, sorry! I’ve been rambling about all sorts of stuff! Honestly, most of the time I just handle random chores like ticketing and maintenance!",
        "zh": "啊不好意思！一直跟你唠叨乱七八糟的东西！其实大部分时间还是在做收门票一类的杂活啦！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Since I can’t remember much history, I’m no good as a tour guide.",
        "zh": "因为我记不住什么历史，所以没法给游客当导游。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 38
    },
